#. module: account_credit_control
#: model:credit.control.policy.level,custom_text:account_credit_control.2_time_1
#: model:credit.control.policy.level,custom_text:account_credit_control.3_time_1
msgid ""
"Our records indicate that we have not received the payment of the invoice "
"mentioned below.\n"
"If it has already been sent, please disregard this notice. If not, please "
"proceed with payment within 10 days.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you in advance for your anticipated cooperation in this matter.\n"
"\n"
"Best regards\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Vores registreringer viser, at vi ikke har modtaget betaling for den "
"nedenfor nævnte faktura.\n"
"Hvis den allerede er afsendt, bedes De se bort fra denne meddelelse. Hvis "
"ikke, bedes De gennemføre betalingen inden 10 dage.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Tak på forhånd for Deres forventede samarbejde i denne sag.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Med venlig hilsen\n"
"        "

#. module: account_credit_control
#: model_terms:credit.control.policy.level,custom_mail_text:account_credit_control.3_time_1
msgid ""
"Our records indicate that we have not received the payment of the invoices "
"mentioned in the attached document.\n"
"  <br>\n"
"  If it has already been sent, please disregard this notice. If not, please "
"proceed with payment within 10 days."
msgstr ""
"Vores registreringer viser, at vi ikke har modtaget betaling for de "
"fakturaer, der er nævnt i det vedhæftede dokument.\n"
"  <br>\n"
"  Hvis det allerede er afsendt, bedes De se bort fra denne meddelelse. Hvis "
"ikke, bedes De gennemføre betalingen inden 10 dage."

#. module: account_credit_control
#: model_terms:credit.control.policy.level,custom_mail_text:account_credit_control.2_time_1
msgid ""
"Our records indicate that we have not received the payment of the invoices "
"mentioned in the attached document.<br>\n"
"  If it has already been sent, please disregard this notice. If not, please "
"proceed with payment within 10 days."
msgstr ""
"Vores registreringer viser, at vi ikke har modtaget betaling for de "
"fakturaer, der er nævnt i det vedhæftede dokument.<br>\n"
"  Hvis det allerede er afsendt, bedes De se bort fra denne meddelelse. Hvis "
"ikke, bedes De gennemføre betalingen inden 10 dage."

#. module: account_credit_control
#: model:credit.control.policy.level,custom_text:account_credit_control.3_time_2
msgid ""
"Our records indicate that we have not yet received the payment of the "
"invoice mentioned below despite our first reminder.\n"
"If it has already been sent, please disregard this notice. If not, please "
"proceed with payment within 5 days.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you in advance for your anticipated cooperation in this matter.\n"
"\n"
"Best regards\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Vores registreringer viser, at vi endnu ikke har modtaget betaling for den "
"nedenfor nævnte faktura, på trods af vores første påmindelse.\n"
"Hvis den allerede er afsendt, bedes De se bort fra denne meddelelse. Hvis "
"ikke, bedes De gennemføre betalingen inden 5 dage.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Tak på forhånd for Deres forventede samarbejde i denne sag.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Med venlig hilsen\n"
"        "

#. module: account_credit_control
#: model_terms:credit.control.policy.level,custom_mail_text:account_credit_control.3_time_2
msgid ""
"Our records indicate that we have not yet received the payment of the "
"invoices mentioned in the attached document despite our first reminder.<br>\n"
"  If it has already been sent, please disregard this notice. If not, please "
"proceed with payment within 5 days."
msgstr ""
"Vores registreringer viser, at vi endnu ikke har modtaget betaling for de "
"fakturaer, der er nævnt i det vedhæftede dokument, på trods af vores første "
"påmindelse.<br>\n"
"  Hvis det allerede er afsendt, bedes De se bort fra denne meddelelse. Hvis "
"ikke, bedes De gennemføre betalingen inden 5 dage."

#. module: account_credit_control
#: model_terms:credit.control.policy.level,custom_mail_text:account_credit_control.2_time_2
msgid ""
"Our records indicate that we still have not received the payment of the "
"invoices mentioned in the attached document despite our reminder."
msgstr ""
"Vores registreringer viser, at vi stadig ikke har modtaget betaling for de "
"fakturaer, der er nævnt i det vedhæftede dokument, på trods af vores "
"påmindelse."

#. module: account_credit_control
#: model_terms:credit.control.policy.level,custom_mail_text:account_credit_control.3_time_3
msgid ""
"Our records indicate that we still have not received the payment of the "
"invoices mentioned in the attached document despite our two reminders.<br>\n"
"  If payment have already been sent, please disregard this notice. If not, "
"please proceed with payment.<br>\n"
"  If your payment has not been received in the next 5 days, your file will "
"be transferred to our debt collection agency."
msgstr ""
"Vores registreringer viser, at vi stadig ikke har modtaget betaling for de "
"fakturaer, der er nævnt i det vedhæftede dokument, på trods af vores to "
"påmindelser.<br>\n"
"  Hvis betalingen allerede er afsendt, bedes De se bort fra denne "
"meddelelse. Hvis ikke, bedes De gennemføre betalingen.<br>\n"
"  Hvis betalingen ikke er modtaget inden for de næste 5 dage, vil Deres sag "
"blive overdraget til vores inkassofirma."

#. module: account_credit_control
#: model:credit.control.policy.level,custom_text:account_credit_control.2_time_2
msgid ""
"Our records indicate that we still have not received the payment of the "
"mentioned below invoice despite our reminder.\n"
"\n"
"If payment have already been sent, please disregard this notice. If not, "
"please proceed with payment.\n"
"If your payment has not been received in the next 5 days, your file will be "
"transferred to our debt collection agency.\n"
"\n"
"Should you need us to arrange a payment plan for you, please advise.\n"
"A customer account statement is enclosed for you convenience.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you in advance for your anticipated cooperation in this matter.\n"
"\n"
"Best regards\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"Vores registreringer viser, at vi stadig ikke har modtaget betaling for den "
"nedenfor nævnte faktura, på trods af vores påmindelse.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Hvis betalingen allerede er afsendt, bedes De se bort fra denne meddelelse. "
"Hvis ikke, bedes De gennemføre betalingen.\n"
"Hvis betalingen ikke er modtaget inden for de næste 5 dage, vil Deres sag "
"blive overdraget til vores inkassofirma.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Hvis De har brug for, at vi arrangerer en betalingsplan, bedes De give os "
"besked.\n"
"En kontooversigt er vedlagt for Deres bekvemmeligheds skyld.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Tak på forhånd for Deres forventede samarbejde i denne sag.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Med venlig hilsen\n"
"        "

